       "text": "ANGLE ID: TT4-N21\nSTATUS: Copy complete · needs footage\nCORE ARGUMENT: A five-step pre-departure routine prevents the most expensive winter surprise: frozen pipes.\nAUDIENCE: Second-home and seasonal owners\nTAKEAWAY: Heat on, water handled, sensor in, someone checking inside, policy read.\nFORMAT: Talking head (on-site optional), ~45 sec · Effort: Low\nSOURCES:\n• General homeowner practice; no insurance or code claims\nBEFORE POSTING:\n• No specific temperature settings or policy terms; points owners to their plumber and insurer."
