       "text": "ANGLE ID: LI3-N26\nSTATUS: Copy complete\nCORE ARGUMENT: The redesigned appraisal format is required for new GSE appraisals as of Nov 2; expect different reports and some transition friction.\nAUDIENCE: Agents, lenders, appraisers, attorneys\nTAKEAWAY: Read the new report before you summarize it; seller documentation matters more.\nFORMAT: Text post · Effort: Low\nSOURCES:\n• Freddie Mac UAD FAQ (mandatory Nov 2, 2026) — https://sf.freddiemac.com/faqs/uad-and-forms-redesign\n• Fannie Mae / Freddie Mac UAD 3.6 timeline — https://singlefamily.fanniemae.com/media/25391/display\n• MPA: Sept 30 policy exception; FHA move — https://www.mpamag.com/us/specialty/wholesale/uad-36-is-here-what-brokers-need-to-do-now/595373\nBEFORE POSTING:\n• Point 3 is labeled as interpretation."
